# MAXCYC 34: the longest instruction takes 34 cycles with the pipelined pass setup and S_CFG; BMC depth 35
# F3: xcordic_core sequencer, with the engine replaced by its contract
#  a_*:   control invariants, stutter lemmas, wrapper contract (unbounded, k-induction)
#  b_*:   one instruction per task: from every clean idle state the core meets sp_alg
#         (complete BMC; engine runs are 1 cycle, F3a's stutter lemma covers longer runs)
#  cov_*: the longest pass sequence of each multi-pass instruction is reachable,
#         and (cov_op17) an instruction on the exact unit completes
#  *_g0 / *_g4: datapath GUARD = 0 (ttsky25a, 16 bits) / GUARD = 4 (20 bits)
[tasks]
a_funcs1_g0 a g0
a_funcs0_g0 a funcs0 g0
b_op0_g0 b op0 g0
b_op1_g0 b op1 g0
b_op2_g0 b op2 g0
b_op3_g0 b op3 g0
b_op4_g0 b op4 g0
